00:09:03.072 --> 00:09:04.773
or why I even get them?

00:09:04.773 --> 00:09:06.804
Well, generally speaking if
you're getting cold sores

00:09:06.804 --> 00:09:09.483
you have herpes, it's herpes simplex.

00:09:09.483 --> 00:09:12.431
It's a virus that stays
dormant inside your body

00:09:12.431 --> 00:09:15.587
unless it breaks out in
a form of a cold sore.

00:09:15.587 --> 00:09:17.905
Now, if you got one cold sore that means

00:09:17.905 --> 00:09:19.268
the virus is with you for life

00:09:19.268 --> 00:09:21.665
and will occasionally pop
out when you're stressed,

00:09:21.665 --> 00:09:23.547
when you have a weakened immune system

00:09:23.547 --> 00:09:26.007
like if you have a virus,
a bacterial infection,

00:09:26.007 --> 00:09:26.840
and so forth.

00:09:26.840 --> 00:09:28.378
My recommendation to you would be talking

00:09:28.378 --> 00:09:29.768
to your doctor about how you can stay

00:09:29.768 --> 00:09:31.939
as healthy as possible which is focusing

00:09:31.939 --> 00:09:33.187
on all your lifestyle habits and then

00:09:33.187 --> 00:09:35.751
if you're still getting
outbreaks very often

00:09:35.751 --> 00:09:37.373
you can talk about a medication

00:09:37.373 --> 00:09:39.010
which is an antiviral medication

00:09:39.010 --> 00:09:40.602
which prevents this outbreaks and you can

00:09:40.602 --> 00:09:43.032
take it daily, not just
when you have an outbreak

00:09:43.032 --> 00:09:44.616
in order to reduce the number of outbreaks

00:09:44.616 --> 00:09:45.495
that you do get.

00:09:45.495 --> 00:09:47.801
Dom The Alien, have you seen an increase

00:09:47.801 --> 00:09:49.952
in patients or people trying to become new

00:09:49.952 --> 00:09:51.916
patients since you started your channel?

00:09:51.916 --> 00:09:52.965
I have seen that.

00:09:52.965 --> 00:09:54.964
It doesn't happen as often as you'd think.

00:09:54.964 --> 00:09:57.134
More often what happens is a patient

00:09:57.134 --> 00:09:59.201
is in a room, I walk in
and they're so surprised

00:09:59.201 --> 00:10:01.139
to see me because they
watch the YouTube channel

00:10:01.139 --> 00:10:02.739
but them reaching out on their own

00:10:02.739 --> 00:10:04.468
doesn't happen often and in general

00:10:04.468 --> 00:10:06.765
I tend to not accept new patients

00:10:06.765 --> 00:10:09.204
because my patient panel is so full.

00:10:09.204 --> 00:10:11.524
There's plenty of great
doctors in my practice

00:10:11.524 --> 00:10:13.091
that are accepting new patients.

00:10:13.091 --> 00:10:15.380
I think you're going to love this playlist

00:10:15.380 --> 00:10:17.198
that I created just for you.

00:10:17.198 --> 00:10:21.154
My favorite videos of 2019
so far, click it, click it.

00:10:21.154 --> 00:10:22.975
Stay happy and healthy.

